MATERIAL PROPERTIES-INPUT FOR 1 TO NMATS                                                                                                              
NAME FOR MATERIAL---FOR COMMENTS                                                                                                                      
FIRST:NAME---MECHANICAL, TEMPERATURE, ETC                                                                                                             
FOR MECHNICAL, SECOND:PHASE---SOLID, FLUID, AIR OR OIL                                                                                                
